        </div>
        <input id="cv-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@company.com" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" required>
        <button type="submit">Request link</button>
      </form>
      <p class="fine" id="cv-pending">Returns <code>202 Accepted</code> and mails a signed URL. Time to live 86400 seconds,
